### =========================================================================
### 🎓 PASSWORD RESET — "nakalimutan ko ang password"
### 📅 Day 59 · Phase 12 (Email)
### =========================================================================
### POST /api/auth/forgot-password { email }
###   → LAGING 202 at parehong mensahe, may account man o wala (hindi malalaman kung sino ang may account)
###   → sumasagot MUNA, saka nagpapadala ng email (sa background) — pareho ang tagal (sinukat: 1.8 vs 1.7ms)
###   → link: <CLIENT_URL>/reset-password#token=...   (1 oras, isang beses lang, ang pinakabago lang ang gagana)
###   → rate limit: 5 bawat 15 minuto bawat IP (bawat request ay puwedeng magpadala ng email)
### POST /api/auth/reset-password { token, newPassword }
###   → isang transaction: gamitin ang token + bagong password + i-logout ang LAHAT ng session
###
### Sa dev: WALANG totoong email (walang RESEND_API_KEY) — ang email ay nasa terminal ng `npm run dev`:
###   📧 Email (hindi ipinadala …) · text: "...#token=AbC123..." ← kopyahin ang token mula rito
###
### 🎨 Sa browser (Day 61): Login → "Nakalimutan ang password?" → /forgot-password → buksan ang BUONG link
###    mula sa terminal (http://localhost:5173/reset-password#token=…) → nawawala ang #token sa address bar → bagong password
###
### Code: backend/src/routes/auth.ts · lib/verificationTokens.ts · lib/background.ts · lib/email.ts
### Test: backend/src/routes/password-reset.test.ts · Diagram: docs/diagrams/18-password-reset.md
### =========================================================================

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 0. Account (isang beses lang — 409 kung mayroon na)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "reset-demo@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Humingi ng reset link. Ang inaasahan:
###    202 { "message": "If an account exists for that email, a reset link has been sent." }
###    Sa terminal: 📧 Email … "Reset your auth-learning password" … /reset-password#token=XXXX
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "reset-demo@example.com"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Email na WALANG account. Ang inaasahan:
###    202 — EKSAKTONG parehong sagot ng #1, at walang email sa terminal
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "walang-ganitong-account@example.com"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Palitan ang password gamit ang link — palitan ang PASTE-DITO ng token mula sa terminal (#1).
###    Ang inaasahan: 204 — at na-logout ang lahat ng session ng account na ito
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE-DITO",
  "newPassword": "bagong-password-789"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Gamitin ULIT ang parehong token. Ang inaasahan:
###    400 { "error": "This reset link is invalid or has expired" } — isang beses lang
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE-DITO",
  "newPassword": "iba-pang-password-000"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Pekeng token. Ang inaasahan: 400 — parehong mensahe (hindi sinasabi kung wala, nagamit na, o expired)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "gawa-gawa-lang",
  "newPassword": "bagong-password-789"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Login gamit ang BAGONG password (pagkatapos ng #3). Ang inaasahan: 200 · ang luma: 401
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "reset-demo@example.com",
  "password": "bagong-password-789"
}
